{{JPExclusive}}
'''Wafer Cat Advent''' (ネコウエハース降臨, ''Nekowehāsu Kōrin'', '''Cat Wafer Advent''') is a group of stages that only appears if the player has purchased the special bundle that includes [[Wafer Cat (Special Cat)|Wafer Cat]] and 1 Rare Ticket. In each stage, [[Wafer Cat XL (Enemy)|Wafer Cat XL]] appears. This event was added in [[Version 10.4 Update|Version 10.4]].

